 "remarks": "This 2-bedroom, 1.5-bathroom condo features a sun-filled interior with a thoughtful, spacious layout. Its generous square footage, classic brick and vinyl exterior, and parking for up to three cars make it an excellent option for buyers seeking comfort, convenience, value, and long-term potential in a walkable neighborhood. The home offers central heating and cooling, an outdoor swimming pool, a new washer and dryer, newer appliances including a refrigerator, dishwasher, microwave, and ducted range hood, engineered wood flooring, ample closet and storage space throughout, a newly painted and refreshed interior, and discounted internet service. Conveniently located approximately a 15-minute walk from Downtown Stamford and the Metro-North train station, this property is well suited for both an owner-occupant and an investor seeking upside potential. Open House Saturday from 12:00 PM to 2:00 PM.",
